Third-Party Notices
===================

Code tables
-----------
No real Boshiamy / 嘸蝦米 `.cin` or compiled code table is included. Only tiny
synthetic fixtures under `crates/boshiamy_core/tests/fixtures/` are present for
automated tests. Users import their own table at runtime.

Language model (character trigram, `BSLM` format)
--------------------------------------------------
The offline correction model is a pruned character trigram trained by
`crates/boshiamy_lm_train` from the pipeline in `tools/lm/`.

Training corpus
  Source   : Chinese Wikipedia, via the Hugging Face dataset
             `wikimedia/wikipedia`, configuration `20231101.zh`
             https://huggingface.co/datasets/wikimedia/wikipedia
  License  : Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
             (Wikipedia text is also available under GFDL.)
  Processing: sentence extraction (`tools/lm/prepare.py`), script
             normalisation to Taiwan Traditional Chinese with OpenCC
             (`t2tw` for Traditional lines, `s2twp` for Simplified lines),
             n-gram counting with interpolated Kneser-Ney smoothing and
             count-threshold pruning.

Distribution
  A model file derived from this corpus is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 with
  attribution to Wikipedia contributors. The Apache-2.0 license of this
  repository's source code does not apply to model files. Model files are not
  committed to this repository; release builds fetch or rebuild them from a
  tagged pipeline run so results are reproducible.

